<description>&lt;p&gt;PKK militants have withdrawn from four camps in northern Iraq as part of a peace process with Turkey, while Iraqi forces have intensified air operations against ISIS hideouts in Kirkuk, using F-16 jets and warplanes. Iraq has raised its military readiness to the highest level and prioritized air defence, and the supreme court has declared the Kurdistan Region security law unconstitutional. The Iraqi government detained 74 border infiltrators, advanced a security wall, and discussed security and investment with Prime Minister Barzani and U.S. Consul General Wendy Green. Finland praised the Kurdistan Region’s neutrality and sees trade opportunities. The conflict recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi_?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxPWllQYWFwY29pUHdUU3JsSkVFU2F6MFhKV2dNQnl4Z2trSUctWWdzVzZqSGw2ZzRhZmpMaUQ3b3d4MTJHNm9nUzdDeWxNUFhKRWlwRHFQSEwxN1pUb3JNQ3ozbHFEUllSRTRvb2VEcl80NXA2bXlibGF0VmpJUDlhQWdNbkF4aV9VbFRpMzhEU2sza1ZhemxDYy1DdTREaV94ZGh4aS10SDN1UlNzYTVxbnJGb2pDdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kurdistan24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxPYXVuTEdtZ3Flb2N4dUo0NUx3Mndsb1Q3LWFsRjBQZUxyUmFJVmNmd2RtNDZPcm1lWkRwQW00LWY3SjI5TGhVaWEyMzJCb3hISDFMUmJQY3BvdDRuNUhlcFpTcGdNdTRuSUdaM0E5cGZVY0RqRXcxSE1nS0RNVUl4OVlORlA5Xy05QlRsSGJwbzZnUHRfMTBra1FacnB6Q3VaREhlNldmRE5jUGE2YnExVUVkcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kurdistan24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxNNk9jam9MOGwzRlh5MUYyY2hiUlp4ZWMtZ2RqaW93RWlBN3g1YzI5dm5JRkt0SjNjcG9CTHNnSDRJRzIxNUxfUjhRR1BfdkFWRkwyenBDdm5iQWRqM2RUMk81RFQ3WlpmVlhyQ0VlNV85ZDRLN3h4MHd1Y3RGdk83UXl2blROVWZ5MlRxY